{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/terms/layout,_N_T_/terms/page,_N_T_/terms"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"hi\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/a082d47af8c37992.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-fe1bb94b21fde89c.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-123aadff3a6f1f43.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/5030-dfb188e0fb5d9176.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-9edc01f96f8414ff.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/5878-ab61975c236bb910.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2972-f2e7899c8cf0f9e3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4a8f5ea9fb7efe7b.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Terms and Conditions | CGSSB.com.in</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Terms and Conditions for CGSSB.com.in.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.jpg\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><header style=\"background-color:var(--bg-body);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;height:70px\"><a style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-primary);letter-spacing:-0.5px\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"CGSSB Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent;border-radius:6px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75\"/>CGSSB</a><nav class=\"desktop-only\" style=\"gap:24px\"><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/jobs\">Jobs</a><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/current-affairs\">Current Affairs</a><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/cg-gk\">CG GK</a><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/tools\">Tools</a></nav><button class=\"mobile-only\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\" style=\"background:none;border:none;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:5px;width:30px;height:30px;cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"display:block;width:25px;height:3px;background-color:var(--text-main);transition:all 0.3s;transform:none\"></span><span style=\"display:block;width:25px;height:3px;background-color:var(--text-main);opacity:1\"></span><span style=\"display:block;width:25px;height:3px;background-color:var(--text-main);transition:all 0.3s;transform:none\"></span></button></div></header><main style=\"min-height:calc(100vh - 70px - 150px)\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"padding-top:60px;padding-bottom:60px;max-width:800px\"><article class=\"card\" style=\"padding:40px;line-height:1.8\"><h1 style=\"font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--color-primary)\">Terms and Conditions</h1><p style=\"color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:30px\"><strong>Last Updated: 16 August 2026</strong></p><div class=\"content-wrapper\" style=\"color:var(--text-main);font-size:1.05rem\"><p>Welcome to CGSSB.com.in.</p><p>By accessing or using this website, you agree to the following Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree with these terms, please discontinue use of the website.</p><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:15px;color:var(--color-primary)\">1. About CGSSB.com.in</h2><p>CGSSB.com.in is an independent informational website.</p><p>The website provides useful information related to:</p><ul class=\"premium-list\"><li>Chhattisgarh government jobs</li><li>CGSSB recruitment</li><li>Examinations</li><li>Admit cards</li><li>Results</li><li>Syllabus</li><li>Answer keys</li><li>Educational updates</li><li>Government notifications</li><li>Other Chhattisgarh-related information</li></ul><p>CGSSB.com.in is not the official website of the Chhattisgarh Staff Selection Board (CGSSB), Chhattisgarh Vyapam or any government department.</p><p>We do not claim to represent or speak on behalf of any government authority.</p><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:15px;color:var(--color-primary)\">2. Use of Website Information</h2><p>We make reasonable efforts to provide useful and accurate information.</p><p>However, government recruitment rules, vacancies, examination dates, eligibility requirements, application procedures and other details may change.</p><p>Therefore, information published on CGSSB.com.in should be treated as informational guidance, not as an official government order.</p><p>For any application or examination-related decision, users should verify the latest information from the relevant official government notification.</p><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:15px;color:var(--color-primary)\">3. Official Sources</h2><p>Where appropriate, our articles may provide links to official government websites and notifications.</p><p>Readers are encouraged to check the original official notification before:</p><ul class=\"premium-list\"><li>Applying for a recruitment</li><li>Paying an examination fee</li><li>Downloading an admit card</li><li>Appearing in an examination</li><li>Relying on eligibility information</li><li>Taking any other important action</li></ul><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:15px;color:var(--color-primary)\">4. No Government Affiliation</h2><p>CGSSB.com.in is independently operated.</p><p>The use of the term CGSSB in the website&#x27;s name does not mean that this website is owned, operated, approved or endorsed by the Chhattisgarh Staff Selection Board.</p><p>The website is not intended to impersonate any government authority.</p><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:15px;color:var(--color-primary)\">5. Intellectual Property</h2><p>Unless otherwise stated, original articles, website design, graphics and other original material created for CGSSB.com.in belong to the website operator.</p><p>Government documents, notifications, logos, trademarks and other materials belonging to government departments or third parties remain the property of their respective owners.</p><p>We do not claim ownership of third-party government documents.</p><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:15px;color:var(--color-primary)\">6. User Submissions</h2><p>If you contact us with feedback, corrections or other information, you agree not to submit unlawful, abusive, fraudulent or malicious material.</p><p>We reserve the right to ignore or remove inappropriate submissions where technically possible.</p><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:15px;color:var(--color-primary)\">7. External Websites</h2><p>CGSSB.com.in may link to external websites.</p><p>These links may include official government portals, educational websites, news websites and other useful resources.</p><p>We do not control those websites and are not responsible for their:</p><ul class=\"premium-list\"><li>Content</li><li>Availability</li><li>Privacy practices</li><li>Security</li><li>Terms and conditions</li></ul><p>Users should review the relevant external website&#x27;s policies before using it.</p><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:15px;color:var(--color-primary)\">8. Advertising</h2><p>CGSSB.com.in may display advertisements from third-party advertising providers.</p><p>The presence of an advertisement does not necessarily mean that CGSSB.com.in recommends or endorses the advertised product or service.</p><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:15px;color:var(--color-primary)\">9. Limitation of Liability</h2><p>We will make reasonable efforts to keep information useful and up to date, but we do not guarantee that every piece of information will always be complete, accurate or current.</p><p>CGSSB.com.in will not be responsible for losses or consequences resulting from reliance solely on information published on this website.</p><p>Users should always verify important information against the latest official source.</p><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:15px;color:var(--color-primary)\">10. Changes to These Terms</h2><p>We may update these Terms and Conditions when necessary.</p><p>The updated version will be published on this page with a revised Last Updated date.</p><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:15px;color:var(--color-primary)\">11. Contact</h2><p>For questions, corrections or concerns regarding these Terms:</p><p><strong>Website:</strong> CGSSB.com.in <br/> <strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:contact@cgssb.com.in\" style=\"color:var(--color-primary)\">contact@cgssb.com.in</a></p></div></article></div></main><footer style=\"background-color:var(--bg-card);border-top:1px solid var(--border-color);padding:40px 0 20px;margin-top:60px\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center\"><h3 style=\"margin-bottom:10px\">Chhattisgarh Career &amp; Education Portal</h3><p style=\"max-width:600px;font-size:0.9rem\">One-stop destination for CGSSB, CGPSC, Vyapam notifications, syllabus, results, and study materials.</p><div style=\"max-width:800px;background-color:#fffbe8;border:1px solid #fde68a;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:6px;margin-top:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#92400e;text-align:left\"><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> CGSSB is an independent informational website and is not affiliated with or operated by the Government of Chhattisgarh, CGSSB, CG Vyapam, CGPSC, or any other government department or examination authority. For official information, please verify details from the relevant official website or notification.</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:15px;margin-top:25px;padding-bottom:25px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color);width:100%;max-width:800px\"><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/about-us\">About Us</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/author/yuvraj-pratap-rajwade\">Author</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/editorial-policy\">Editorial Policy</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/correction-policy\">Correction Policy</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/contact-us\">Contact Us</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/terms\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/disclaimer\">Disclaimer</a></div><div style=\"margin-top:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-muted)\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> CGSSB Portal. Built for the students of Chhattisgarh. <br/>Email us at: <a href=\"mailto:contact@cgssb.com.in\" style=\"color:var(--color-primary)\">contact@cgssb.com.in</a></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-fe1bb94b21fde89c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/a082d47af8c37992.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"2:I[2846,